			"notes": "- A PvP Dimensions demo: build a miniature at a bench on a flat field, stepping into the workshop and back as you would anywhere. The demo waits while you build, and if it ends while you are in the box you are brought out first, with only your own things coming home.\n- Needs Pandorical 15.39 or later."
