			"notes": "- A miniature on a Big Boats ship shows its little build on deck while she sails, not just when she docks.\n- Build together: any number of people can step into one bench's box at once and build from its one supply, each with their own pack kept safe.\n- Change a bench's size with materials loaded: everything is cut again to the new size, nothing lost."
		},
